**Documentos hermanos:** [`fe-research-line.mdc`](./fe-research-line.mdc) · [`fe-unit-forge.mdc`](./fe-unit-forge.mdc) · [`atelier-synergy-vshowroom.mdc`](./atelier-synergy-vshowroom.mdc) · **sitio emancipado CD:** `~/projects/…/universidadeuropea/digital-creativity-uem/` (Pages propias + `digital-creativity-pedagogy/grounding/`) · [`grounding/README.mdc`](./grounding/README.mdc) · [`profield-frontend-pedagogy.md`](./profield-frontend-pedagogy.md)

